# Story Dashboard Frames

Placeholder for the viral unslop story video frames. Eight frames showing the before/after transformation of a dashboard screen from slop to craft.

Frame 1: Original screen with purple gradients, glow effects, emoji labels
Frame 2: Spacing pass - 4px grid, equal gaps
Frame 3: Color pass - neutral ramp, one accent
Frame 4: Icons pass - line icons replacing emoji
Frame 5: Copy pass - sentence case, no hype words
Frame 6: Type pass - one family, proper scale
Frame 7: Layout pass - asymmetric hero, quiet chrome
Frame 8: Final - one bright element, quiet chrome, product-specific character

This is a placeholder file. Replace with actual webp frames when available.
